# StockFlow Pro

Tagline: Inventory management that thinks for you.

Predict what you need to buy and automate your restocking.

Running out of stock is frustrating, but having too much tied up in a warehouse is just as bad. StockFlow Pro uses AI to look at your sales and tell you exactly what to reorder. It syncs with Amazon and Shopify so your numbers are always right.

Key features:
- Demand Prediction: AI forecasts sales. Never run out.
- Multi-Channel: Syncs Amazon & Shopify. No overselling.
- Auto-PO: Drafts purchase orders. Save admin time.
- Barcode App: Scan items with phone. Easy tracking.

Benefits:
- Optimized Cash Flow
- Less Admin
- Accurate Stock
- Grow Faster

FAQs:

Q: Is it hard to set up?
A: It connects to Shopify and Amazon in 1 click using our official apps.

Q: Does it work with eBay?
A: Yes, we support eBay, Walmart, and custom WooCommerce stores.

Q: How far ahead can it predict?
A: Our AI provides accurate forecasts for up to 90 days based on your historical data.

Q: Can it handle 3 warehouses?
A: Absolutely. It tracks "Transfers" between locations and suggests optimal stock distribution.

Q: Do we need special scanners?
A: No, your staff can use the StockFlow mobile app to scan barcodes with their smartphone cameras.

Q: Will it save us money?
A: Most clients reduce "Dead Stock" by 20% within 6 months, freeing up significant cash flow.

Q: What if a product is new?
A: For new items, the AI uses "Proxy Modeling"—looking at similar products in your sector to estimate demand.

Q: Do you help with migration?
A: Yes, our Enterprise plan includes a dedicated data specialist to help upload your old records.

Q: What does the "Demand Prediction" capability include?
A: AI forecasts sales. The benefit: never run out.

Q: What does the "Multi-Channel" capability include?
A: Syncs Amazon & Shopify. The benefit: no overselling.